<title>USA: Giga-tronics says CFO Overholtzer leaving.</title>
<headline>Giga-tronics says CFO Overholtzer leaving.</headline>
<dateline>SAN RAMON, Calif. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Giga-tronics Inc said Wednesday that Chief Financial Officer Greg Overholtzer will leave the company to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>The company gave no details, and officials were not available for comment.</p>
</text>
